{"type":"math","value":"ef"},{"type":"text","value":"、"},{"type":"math","value":"gh"},{"type":"text","value":" 组成，与弹射系统的导轨成30°夹角，f、h间接一恒流源，可提供恒定电流 "},{"type":"math","value":"I"},{"type":"text","value":"。弹射系统与回收系统相互绝缘，整个弹射平台处于垂直于平台面、磁感应强度为B的匀强磁场中。平台左侧的线圈通过开关K与弹射系统的a、c端相连，线圈匝数为n、电阻为R、面积为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"；垂直于线圈平面有磁感应强度大小随时间变化关系为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1}=B_{0}+k_{1}t"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"k_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为确定常数）的磁场。闭合K，金属棒向右加速经过时间t达最大速度（未到达bd端），该过程中金属棒和无人机受到的阻力恒定为 "},{"type":"math","value":"k_{2}Bl"},{"type":"text","value":"（"},{"type":"math","value":"k_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 为确定常数）。金属棒到达 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{b}\\mathbf{d}"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，无人机分离弹射出去；此后，金属棒在恒流源作用下减速并返回，以完成回收。金属棒全程没有脱离导轨，求：\n（1）在闭合K瞬间金属棒的电流；\n（2）金属棒达最大速度时电压表示数；\n（3）金属棒达最大速度过程中线圈提供的能量；\n（4）金属棒最远的位置到bd的距离。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f284e0eb60c01a84601a7e64332e7f5a6d1bfbfeb56f7a318916a0e8b2c10b43.png","width":1026,"height":695,"width_mm":120.54,"row_group":"jiaxing-jice-2609-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"score","value":"（12分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"E_0=nS\\frac{\\Delta B_1}{\\Delta t}=nSk_1"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"I_0=\\frac{E_0}{2R}=\\frac{nSk_1}{2R}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（2）金属棒达最大速度时合外力为零"},{"type":"math","value":"BI_1l=k_2Bl"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"I_1=k_2"},{"type":"math","value":"U=E_0-I_1R"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math","value":"=nSk_1-Rk_2"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（3）"},{"type":"math","value":"I_1=\\frac{E_0-Blv}{2R}"},{"type":"text","value":"\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v=\\frac{nSk_1-2Rk_2}{Bl}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"math