子数之比值）可达到 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 ^ { 8 } { \\sim } 1 0 ^ { 1 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 倍，从而产生强烈的电子脉冲信号。已知电子的质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 9 \\times 10^{-31} kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ，电子电量 "},{"type":"math","value":"e = 1.6 \\times 10^{-19} C"},{"type":"text","value":" ，普朗克常量 "},{"type":"math","value":"h=6.63 \\times 10^{-34} J \\cdot s"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（1）如图2所示，从阴极出射的光电子收集后从P点垂直进入磁感应强度 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = 0.003\\mathrm{T}"},{"type":"text","value":"的匀强磁场，收集板上最远打到的位置距离入射点4mm。已知入射光的波长为200nm，则：\n①阴极材料的逸出功 "},{"type":"math","value":"W _ { 0 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 为多少 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf { e V }"},{"type":"text","value":"？\n②逸出的光电子加速到 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf { D _ { 1 } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 电极，光电子德布罗意波长的最小值。\n（2）用一个可放大 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf { 1 0 ^ { 5 } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 倍的光电倍增管将某一微弱的光信号转换并增强为电信号后，输出端串联一个50"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"的电阻，形成回路。此电阻两端电压U与时间t的关系如图3所示。光子照射到阴极时，约有30%可以击出光电子，求射入此光电倍增管的光子数；\n（3）结合光电倍增管原理，写出两种提高光电倍增管放大倍数的可行措施。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/35c8647734f8720f05eb0935d150d8dbdf12171f307eee3be82b5a9d32bc4291.png","width":1026,"height":557,"width_mm":120.582,"row_group":"jiaxing-jice-2609-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/c6453792843e515c4d6ef11007b8b9bfac5ae2682df1265d3034012eb6e1afcf.png","width":246,"height":272,"width_mm":28.77,"row_group":"jiaxing-jice-2609-q18-row1"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0bf45027d4a58b9e0044fbbc37f43b3464e9a5b57bbf41d227900cb1d4061394.png","width":337,"height":203,"width_mm":39.48,"row_group":"jiaxing-jice-2609-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n图2\n图3\n"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"score","value":"（13分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"（1）①"},{"type":"math","value":"r=\\frac{mv_0}{eB}"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\n"},{"type":"text","value":"入射光能量为"},{"type":"math","value":"h\\frac c\\lambda"},{"type":"score","value":"（1分）\